---
<section class="bundle feat--sky section">
  <div class="wrap bundle__inner">
    <p class="bundle__copy serif" data-reveal>
      Or get the Every bundle for full access to all of our apps — Cora, Spiral, and Sparkle —
      and ideas at the frontier of AI, for only $20 per month.
    </p>
    <a href="#login" class="btn btn--white bundle__btn" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:.1s">Subscribe to Every <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>

    <figure class="bundle__quote" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:.16s">
      <blockquote class="serif">
        “I've tried all these newfangled AI email apps, and the winner, by far, is Cora by Every.”
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption>
        <img src="/images/people/andrewwilkinson.jpg" alt="Andrew Wilkinson" width="44" height="44" />
        <span><strong>Andrew Wilkinson</strong><em>Founder at Tiny</em></span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bundle { padding: clamp(64px, 10vw, 120px) 0; }
  .bundle__inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 26px;
  }
  .bundle__copy {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .bundle__quote {
    margin-top: 30px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 30px 32px;
    max-width: 620px;
  }
  .bundle__quote blockquote {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 26px);
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .bundle__quote figcaption {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .bundle__quote figcaption img { border-radius: 50%; }
  .bundle__quote span { display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: left; line-height: 1.3; }
  .bundle__quote strong { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; }
  .bundle__quote em { font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }
</style>
